flowchart LR
    subgraph Clients
        React[React dashboard]
    end
    subgraph API
        AppSync{{AppSync GraphQL}}
    end
    subgraph Services["Independently deployable Lambda services"]
        T[telemetry-api]
        P[prediction-api]
        Al[alerting-service]
        Tw[digital-twin-service]
        Ing[ingestion-trigger]
    end
    subgraph Stores
        TS[(Timestream)]
        DDB[(DynamoDB)]
        RDS[(RDS Postgres)]
        MLS[Databricks Model Serving]
    end
    subgraph Events
        EB{{EventBridge}}
        S3Evt[[S3 ObjectCreated]]
    end

    React <--> AppSync
    AppSync <-->|query| T
    AppSync <-->|query| P
    AppSync <-->|query| Al
    AppSync <-->|subscription| Tw

    T --> TS
    Al --> DDB
    Al --> RDS
    P --> MLS
    Tw --> TS
    Tw --> DDB

    EB -->|new prediction/Gold data| Al
    EB -->|schedule/new telemetry| Tw
    S3Evt --> Ing
    Ing -.triggers job.-> MLS
